sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ed as Editor
    participant P as Prompt service
    participant O as Object store
    participant R as Run service
    participant M as Model API
    Ed->>Ed: edits applied locally — no network on a keystroke
    Ed->>P: debounced draft autosave (delta, not the whole body)
    Ed->>O: large bodies go direct via a presigned URL
    Ed->>P: commit a version
    P->>P: immutable PromptVersion {bodyRef, hash, size}
    Ed->>R: run {promptVersionId, settings, model}
    R->>R: estimate tokens and cost, check budget before spending
    R->>O: stream the body by ref, verify the hash
    R->>M: run against the pinned model version
    M-->>R: token stream
    R-->>Ed: SSE deltas, buffered so a drop resumes rather than re-bills
    R->>O: persist output, record real usage and cost
